---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Beat from "../components/Beat.astro";
import Glow from "../components/Glow.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import Cta from "../components/Cta.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import { person } from "../lib/schema";
import portrait from "../assets/stuart-davis.jpg";

const crumbs = [
  { name: "Home", href: "/" },
  { name: "About", href: "/about/" },
];

const facts = [
  { term: "What we are", detail: "An AI and business transformation advisory" },
  { term: "Founded", detail: "2026, by Stuart Davis" },
  { term: "Based", detail: "United Kingdom" },
  { term: "What we sell", detail: "Advice and leadership. No software, no tools." },
];

const gaps = [
  {
    title: "Deciding where to invest",
    body: "Use cases and local productivity gains haven't become a short list of choices about revenue, cost, capacity or customers.",
  },
  {
    title: "Changing the business around it",
    body: "Products, workflows, roles and decisions haven't adapted to what the new tools can do.",
  },
  {
    title: "Getting it done",
    body: "Nobody owns the outcome, or the people and coordination needed to deliver it aren't in place.",
  },
];

const choices = [
  {
    title: "Small and senior on purpose",
    body: "You work directly with the person leading the work, from the first leadership conversation to the teams making the change. Specialists are added only where the problem needs them.",
  },
  {
    title: "Independent",
    body: "We don't sell software, resell tools or take payment by results. When we recommend building, buying or stopping something, nothing else sits behind that advice.",
  },
  {
    title: "Every step stands on its own",
    body: "The first steps have fixed fees agreed before work starts. You can stop after any stage and keep everything produced so far.",
  },
  {
    title: "Built to hand over",
    body: "Outputs, decisions and methods belong to you. We train your people on their redesigned work so the change keeps going after we leave.",
  },
];

const triggers = [
  "The board expects an AI strategy, and nobody can yet say which opportunities are strongest.",
  "Pilots and tool purchases are multiplying, with nothing to show in the numbers.",
  "A product, digital or AI transformation needs an independent diagnosis or a senior leader to own it.",
];
---

<Base
  title="About Neurally"
  description="Neurally is a UK-based AI and business transformation advisory, founded by Stuart Davis in 2026. Why it exists, what it is for and how it works with leadership teams."
  crumbs={crumbs}
  schema={[person()]}
>
  <section class="pt-10 pb-16 lg:pt-14 lg:pb-24" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="fade-up">
        <Breadcrumbs crumbs={crumbs} />
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid items-end gap-x-10 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-12 lg:mt-14 lg:gap-x-12">
        <div class="md:col-span-8">
          <h1 id="page-heading" class="text-display">
            <span class="line-rise" style="--i:0">
              <span>About Neurally.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="line-rise text-muted" style="--i:1">
              <span>Built for the work after the pilot.</span>
            </span>
          </h1>
          <p class="fade-up text-muted mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl" style="--i:3">
            We help leadership teams decide where AI is worth the investment, redesign the business around it
            and lead the change through to measured results.
          </p>
          <div class="fade-up mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-4" style="--i:4">
            <Button href={site.calendly} external size="lg" data-cta="calendly">
              Book a free discovery call
            </Button>
            <Button href={site.linkedinCompany} external variant="text">
              Neurally on LinkedIn
            </Button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <dl class="fade-up tile md:col-span-4" style="--i:2">
          {facts.map((f) => (
            <div class="border-line border-b py-4 first:pt-0 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0">
              <dt class="text-faint text-sm">{f.term}</dt>
              <dd class="mt-1">{f.detail}</dd>
            </div>
          ))}
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Section glow={{ side: "right", colours: ["decide", "lilac"] }} tone="paper" labelledby="why-heading">
    <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <Beat
          id="why-heading"
          first="Why Neurally exists."
          second="Experiments show what AI can do. They don't decide what your business should do with it."
        />
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal style="--i:1">
        <p class="text-lg">Trying AI is the easy part. What comes next tends to stall in three places.</p>
        <ol class="rows mt-8">
          {gaps.map((g, i) => (
            <li class="row grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 md:grid-cols-12">
              <span class="text-faint text-sm pt-1.5 md:col-span-1">0{i + 1}</span>
              <div class="md:col-span-11">
                <h3 class="font-display text-xl">{g.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mt-2">{g.body}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <p class="text-muted mt-8 text-lg">
          Closing those gaps takes business design and someone to lead the change, as well as technology
          expertise. Neurally was set up to do all three, with one accountable lead from the board decision
          through to delivery.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section glow={{ side: "left", colours: ["design", "embed"] }} labelledby="mission-heading">
    <p class="text-faint text-sm" data-reveal>
      Our mission
    </p>
    <p id="mission-heading" class="font-display text-headline mt-6 max-w-5xl" data-reveal style="--i:1">
      To help established businesses turn AI from experiments into results they can measure, and leave their
      own teams able to carry the work on.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section glow={{ side: "right", colours: ["deliver", "design"] }} tone="paper" labelledby="choices-heading">
    <div data-reveal>
      <Beat id="choices-heading" first="How Neurally is set up." second="Four choices we made on purpose." />
    </div>
    <ul class="tiles mt-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      {choices.map((c, i) => (
        <li class="tile" data-reveal style={`--i:${i % 2}`}>
          <h3 class="text-title">{c.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mt-3 text-lg">{c.body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section glow={{ side: "left", colours: ["lilac", "decide"] }} labelledby="help-heading">
    <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <Beat id="help-heading" first="Who we help." second="And when they tend to call." />
        <p class="text-muted mt-6 max-w-md text-lg">
          CEOs, founders, and product and technology leaders of scaling and established businesses, roughly 50
          to 1,000 people. Boards and investors also bring us in for an independent view.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted mt-4 max-w-md text-lg">
          Our experience runs deepest in financial services and insurance, marketplaces and e-commerce, and
          B2B SaaS. Professional services is a growing focus.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <ul class="rows">
          {triggers.map((t, i) => (
            <li class="row font-display text-title flex gap-5" data-reveal style={`--i:${i}`}>
              <span class="text-faint text-sm mt-2">0{i + 1}</span>
              {t}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4" data-reveal>
          <Button href="/approach/" variant="text">
            How the approach works
          </Button>
          <Button href="/services/" variant="text">
            Services and fees
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="paper" labelledby="founder-heading" id="stuart-davis">
    <div class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-x-12">
      <!-- The reveal sits on the image only: a revealed element is clipped
           to its own box, which would cut the glow off. -->
      <div class="relative isolate md:col-span-4">
        <Glow side="behind" colours={["deliver", "decide", "lilac"]} />
        <div data-reveal>
          <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Stuart Davis, founder of Neurally"
            widths={[320, 480, 640]}
            sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 30vw, 80vw"
            class="aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-sm rounded-2xl object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative md:col-span-8">
        <div data-reveal>
          <Beat
            id="founder-heading"
            first="Founded by Stuart Davis."
            second="Nineteen years running the change from the inside."
          />
          <p class="max-w-measure mt-6 text-lg">
            Stuart has spent more than 19 years leading product, technology and transformation. Most recently,
            as Head of Product (Data, AI, Apps & Ops) at Compare the Market, he wrote the consumer AI
            strategy, won board backing for it and led the launch of the company's first consumer AI
            assistant. Before that he was Head of Product (Banking & Payments) at Fresha.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted max-w-measure mt-4 text-lg">He leads every Neurally engagement himself.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-faint mt-4 text-sm">Career before Neurally, not Neurally client work.</p>
        <Button href={site.linkedin} external variant="secondary" class="mt-8">
          Stuart on LinkedIn
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Cta first="Tell us what you're trying to decide." second="Thirty minutes, free." />
</Base>
